n lost leadership as faster vertically integrated competitors emerged."},"sources":[{"title":"Introducing DYDX","url":"https://www.dydx.foundation/blog/introducing-dydx-token"},{"title":"dYdX integration documentation","url":"https://docs.dydx.xyz/"},{"title":"dYdX v4 perpetual-markets indexer","url":"https://indexer.dydx.trade/v4/perpetualMarkets"},{"title":"DefiLlama dYdX v4 protocol TVL","url":"https://defillama.com/protocol/dydx-v4"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-29"},{"slug":"hyperliquid","type":"dex","venue_type":"exchange","name":"Hyperliquid","launched":"2023","primary_chain":"Hyperliquid L1","status":"successful_established","metric_label":"24h perpetual notional volume","metric_type":"perpetual_notional_volume_24h","metric_unit":"USD","metric":3422241526,"why_successful":"Hyperliquid vertically integrated a purpose-built chain and fully on-chain order book to provide CEX-like execution with self-custody, then expanded into spot and general smart-contract execution.","outlook":"Strong growth and category leadership, with material derivatives-regulatory, validator-centralization, frontend, and single-protocol-chain concentration risks.","profile":{"operational_model":"app-specific Layer 1 with fully on-chain central-limit order books for perpetual futures and spot markets","chains":["Hyperliquid L1"],"token":{"launched":true,"symbol":"HYPE","launch_date":"2024-11-29","role":"native network token used for security, network costs, discounts and ecosystem coordination","source_url":"https://www.hyperfoundation.org/"},"metrics":{"perpetual_notional_volume_24h_usd":3422241526,"perpetual_open_interest_usd":7023217425,"spot_volume_24h_protocol_api_usd":80427614,"spot_volume_24h_defillama_usd":96296488,"spot_volume_30d_defillama_usd":2674187482,"spot_tvl_usd":138702508,"as_of":"2026-07-29","source_url":"https://api.hyperliquid.xyz/info","method_note":"Protocol API totals sum dayNtlVlm across metaAndAssetCtxs and spotMetaAndAssetCtxs. DefiLlama spot uses a different window or methodology and is retained separately."},"success_factors":["vertical_chain_exchange_integration","low_latency_orderbook","self_custody_execution","community_distribution","fee_funded_buybacks"],"risks":["single_protocol_chain_concentration","validator_centralization","frontend_dependency","derivatives_regulation"],"synthesis":"The result is a vertically integrated chain-and-exchange case, not a conventional application on a neutral chain."},"sources":[{"title":"Hyper Foundation","url":"https://www.hyperfoundation.org/"},{"title":"Hyperliquid API documentation","url":"https://hyperliquid.gitbook.io/hyperliquid-docs/for-developers/api/info-endpoint"},{"title":"Hyperliquid protocol API","url":"https://api.hyperliquid.xyz/info"},{"title":"DefiLlama Hyperliquid spot daily-volume series","url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/hyperliquid?dataType=dailyVolume"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-29"},{"slug":"jupiter","type":"dex","venue_type":"exchange","name":"Jupiter","launched":"2021-10","primary_chain":"Solana","status":"successful_established","metric_label":"24h aggregator-routed volume","metric_type":"aggregator_routed_volume_24h","metric_unit":"USD","metric":467931581,"why_successful":"Jupiter built an order-flow and best-execution moat by routing across Solana liquidity and distributing that routing through wallets and applications.","outlook":"Durable router and product suite, but routed volume overlaps underlying venues and must never be added to Raydium, Orca, or Meteora volume.","profile":{"operational_model":"Solana liquidity aggregator and execution router; the broader suite includes perpetuals, lending and launch tooling","chains":["Solana"],"token":{"launched":true,"symbol":"JUP","launch_date":"2024-01-31","role":"DAO governance and ecosystem coordination","source_url":"https://discuss.jup.ag/t/jup-the-genesis-post/478/1"},"metrics":{"aggregator_routed_volume_24h_usd":467931581,"aggregator_routed_volume_30d_usd":17658631543,"aggregator_routed_volume_all_time_usd":1262640946438,"peak_daily_aggregator_volume_usd":23824576071,"peak_daily_aggregator_volume_date":"2025-01-19","tvl_usd":null,"as_of":"2026-07-29","source_url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/aggregators/jupiter?dataType=dailyVolume","comparability_note":"Routed volume can execute against underlying DEX liquidity and is not additive."},"success_factors":["best_execution_router","wallet_distribution","solana_liquidity_network_effect","product_expansion","community_distribution"],"risks":["volume_overlap","single_chain_concentration","suite_complexity","uncertain_token_value_capture"],"synthesis":"Jupiter demonstrates that distribution and execution quality can dominate owned pool liquidity. Its activity is flow-through, not additive protocol liquidity."},"sources":[{"title":"JUP Genesis Post","url":"https://discuss.jup.ag/t/jup-the-genesis-post/478/1"},{"title":"JUP tokenomics","url":"https://docs.jup.ag/user-docs/more/jup-token/tokenomics"},{"title":"DefiLlama Jupiter aggregator daily-volume series","url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/aggregators/jupiter?dataType=dailyVolume"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-29"},{"slug":"meteora","type":"dex","venue_type":"exchange","name":"Meteora","launched":null,"primary_chain":"Solana","status":"successful_established","metric_label":"24h spot volume","metric_type":"spot_volume_24h","metric_unit":"USD","metric":118517674,"why_successful":"Meteora converted dynamic liquidity design and token-launch infrastructure into a distribution funnel across DLMM, DAMM, and bonding-curve products on Solana.","outlook":"Successful but cycle-sensitive. Durable performance should be judged by post-launch liquidity retention and fee yield, not launch-day turnover.","profile":{"operational_model":"Solana liquidity infrastructure with dynamic concentrated-liquidity, constant-product and bonding-curve pools","chains":["Solana"],"token":{"launched":true,"symbol":"MET","launch_date":null,"role":null,"source_url":"https://defillama.com/protocol/meteora-dlmm"},"metrics":{"spot_volume_24h_usd":118517674,"spot_volume_30d_usd":3563692197,"spot_volume_all_time_usd":287786443119,"spot_tvl_usd":239254950,"as_of":"2026-07-29","source_url":"https://api.llama.fi/overview/dexs?excludeTotalDataChart=true&excludeTotalDataChartBreakdown=true","method_note":"Volume sums DefiLlama DAMM v1, DLMM and DAMM v2 rows parented to Meteora. Launchpad-category Dynamic Bonding Curve volume is excluded."},"success_factors":["dynamic_liquidity_design","token_launch_infrastructure","solana_distribution","multiple_pool_types","aggregator_composability"],"risks":["single_chain_concentration","launch_cycle_sensitivity","complex_lp_risk","token_role_source_gap"],"synthesis":"The predictive question is whether volume remains after launch cohorts mature; retention and fee yield net of incentives matter more than launch-day turnover."},"sources":[{"title":"Meteora product overview","url":"https://docs.meteora.ag/get-started/pushing-the-boundaries-of-defi"},{"title":"Meteora protocol metrics API documentation","url":"https://docs.meteora.ag/api-reference/dlmm/stats/protocol-overview"},{"title":"DefiLlama DEX overview","url":"https://api.llama.fi/overview/dexs?excludeTotalDataChart=true&excludeTotalDataChartBreakdown=true"},{"title":"DefiLlama Meteora DLMM protocol TVL","url":"https://defillama.com/protocol/meteora-dlmm"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-29"},{"slug":"pancakeswap","type":"dex","venue_type":"exchange","name":"PancakeSwap","launched":"2020-09","primary_chain":"BNB Chain","status":"successful_established","metric_label":"24h spot volume","metric_type":"spot_volume_24h","metric_unit":"USD","metric":663384016,"why_successful":"PancakeSwap paired low-cost BNB Chain distribution with aggressive liquidity incentives, then expanded into a multi-chain and multi-product exchange suite.","outlook":"Large and durable, but incentive dependence and liquidity fragmentation across versions remain important. Product-funded CAKE burns should be measured against emissions rather than treated as success by announcement.","profile":{"operational_model":"multi-chain spot AMM suite with constant-product, concentrated-liquidity, stableswap and Infinity versions","chains":["BNB Chain","Ethereum","Base","Arbitrum","Aptos","Solana","Linea","zkSync Era","multiple additional chains"],"token":{"launched":true,"symbol":"CAKE","launch_date":null,"role":"governance, liquidity incentives and ecosystem utility; current policy targets net deflation through product-funded burns","source_url":"https://docs.pancakeswap.finance/protocol/cake-tokenomics"},"metrics":{"spot_volume_24h_usd":663384016,"spot_volume_30d_usd":17632289859,"spot_volume_all_time_usd":2052762586233,"spot_tvl_usd":2033797649,"peak_daily_spot_volume_usd":12765125928,"peak_daily_spot_volume_date":"2021-05-19","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/pancakeswap?dataType=dailyVolume"},"success_factors":["bnb_chain_retail_distribution","low_fee_environment","multi_product_suite","multi_chain_expansion","token_emission_management"],"risks":["incentive_dependence","version_fragmentation","host_chain_concentration"],"synthesis":"Chain distribution was a launch advantage without remaining a permanent constraint. CAKE bootstrapped liquidity, but repeated tokenomics changes show emissions remain an operating liability unless fee-generating products absorb them."},"sources":[{"title":"CAKE Tokenomics","url":"https://docs.pancakeswap.finance/protocol/cake-tokenomics"},{"title":"DefiLlama PancakeSwap daily-volume series","url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/pancakeswap?dataType=dailyVolume"},{"title":"DefiLlama PancakeSwap protocol TVL","url":"https://defillama.com/protocol/pancakeswap-amm"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-29"},{"slug":"raydium","type":"dex","venue_type":"exchange","name":"Raydium","launched":"2021-02","primary_chain":"Solana","status":"successful_established","metric_label":"24h spot volume","metric_type":"spot_volume_24h","metric_unit":"USD","metric":74249521,"why_successful":"Raydium became core Solana liquidity infrastructure through multiple pool designs, permissionless integrations, aggregator routing, and a token-launch-to-secondary-liquidity pipeline.","outlook":"Successful but highly cyclical. Volume is far below its January 2025 peak and remains sensitive to Solana token-launch and memecoin activity.","profile":{"operational_model":"Solana AMM suite spanning classic AMM, constant-product, concentrated liquidity and token-launch liquidity","chains":["Solana"],"token":{"launched":true,"symbol":"RAY","launch_date":null,"role":"protocol token with fee-funded buybacks; official documentation states 12% of trading fees fund RAY buybacks","source_url":"https://docs.raydium.io/ray/ray-buybacks"},"metrics":{"spot_volume_24h_usd":74249521,"spot_volume_30d_usd":2414945073,"spot_volume_all_time_usd":713047894633,"spot_tvl_usd":816667896,"peak_daily_spot_volume_usd":13190492841,"peak_daily_spot_volume_date":"2025-01-18","as_of":"2026-07-29","source_url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/raydium?dataType=dailyVolume"},"success_factors":["solana_native_infrastructure","aggregator_composability","multiple_pool_designs","launch_liquidity_pipeline","fee_funded_buybacks"],"risks":["single_chain_concentration","cycle_sensitivity","volume_drawdown","solana_dex_competition"],"synthesis":"Wallets and aggregators route into Raydium even when users do not visit its interface, converting chain-specific infrastructure into a distribution moat."},"sources":[{"title":"What is Raydium","url":"https://docs.raydium.io/introduction/what-is-raydium"},{"title":"RAY buybacks","url":"https://docs.raydium.io/ray/ray-buybacks"},{"title":"DefiLlama Raydium daily-volume series","url":"https://api.llama.fi/summary/dexs/raydium?dataType=dailyVolume"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-29"},{"slug":"thorchain","type":"dex","venue_type":"exchange","name":"THORChain","launched":"2021-04","primary_chain":"THORChain","status":"successful_established","metric_labe